    "text": "[Unpaid advertisement] - Another delicious day in Berlin… \n\n- Started the day at @akkurat.cafe and visiting @dave_doppio behind the bar. Beautiful breakfast & coffee…and even more beautiful people! What a treat 🙏🏻♥️.\n- Somehow we ended up shopping at KaDeWe and visited @goldies.bar (from the same guys behind @goldies______). To my surprise @vladi_ga_ching was there and I asked him if they still had their steakhouse burger today or if it was sold out…and guess what, only one was left…and it was mine hehe. That burger is lit 🔥😮‍💨 and if you haven’t tried it yet…you should!\n- And ending the day in \"Kreuzkölln“ at one of my favorite pizza places @gazzopizza. That pumpkin pizza was also on point! Mouth watering… And the house lemonade. Give me 5 liters of it please! \n\n🫶🏻🫰🏻 // #berlin",
